# write a presentation about a topic
@k.procedures.method.write_a_presentation_about_a_topic k.procedures.method name="write a presentation about a topic" about="A presentation (the genre \"presentation\" of k.genres) about a topic: choose three to five points, statements of the catalog about the topic on different keys, sampled by k.interest; then make the document, the title, agenda, summary and closing slides, and one content slide per point." act=make world=w.document example="write a presentation about penguins" example="make slides about Peru" core.source="hand-core 1"
