# write a report of what was done
@k.procedures.method.write_a_report_of_what_was_done k.procedures.method name="write a report of what was done" about="A report (the genre \"report\" of k.genres) of what was done in the session: choose one to six of the acts done (the history), one to four things there now as results, and one to three acts not yet done as next steps, sampled by k.interest; then make the document and one chapter per required part (summary, introduction, work done, results, next steps)." act=make world=w.document example="write a report" example="a report about what we did" core.source="hand-core 1"
